act details\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"safety-qn-help-page\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"guideline\", \"record_kind\": \"guideline\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"SECTION_SUPERSEDED\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"history\", \"replaced_by\": [{\"replaced_by\": \"safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0\", \"section\": \"Contact details\", \"replacement_effective\": \"2026-09-10T13:00:00Z\"}]}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-08-20T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-08-20T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"safety_classification\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"NO_APPROVAL_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"partially_superseded\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[HISTORICAL - NOT CURRENT GUIDANCE: section 'Contact details' superseded by safety-fictional-pii-clarification@1.0 (effective 2026-09-10T13:00:00Z). May explain an old rule; do not apply it as current.]\\n## Contact details\\nQuarantine any task containing a phone number, email address or personal contact identifier while a reviewer checks its status. Under this version, a claim that the contact detail is made up does not remove that initial quarantine requirement.\\n\\nRetain the surrounding context with the flagged task. Clearly identifiable private information remains subject to the project's privacy review.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:safety-doc-sync-outcome@1.0:cd4505b9\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"PRIOR_DECISION\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"safety-doc-sync-outcome@1.0\", \"title\": \"Documentation follow-up — FAQ updated, old help page still stale\", \"sections\": [\"Follow-up inspection\", 